msgstr "配置字段"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:55
msgid "``fp8``"
msgstr "``fp8``"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:56
msgid ""
"Quantize each element to 8-bit float; dequantize on load. Lossy but "
"highly compressible."
msgstr "将每个元素量化为 8 位浮点数；在加载时反量化。虽然有损，但高度可压缩。"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:58
msgid ""
"``fp8_dtype`` (default ``float8_e4m3fn``; also accepts ``float8_e5m2``), "
"``max_workers`` (thread pool size, default 1)"
msgstr ""
"``fp8_dtype``\\ （默认 ``float8_e4m3fn``\\ ；也接受 ``float8_e5m2``\\ ），\\ "
"``max_workers``\\ （线程池大小，默认 1）"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:61
msgid "``turboquant``"
msgstr "``turboquant``"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:62
msgid ""
"Compress KV tensors with TurboQuant presets before L2 store and "
"reconstruct them on load."
msgstr "在 L2 存储之前使用 TurboQuant 预设压缩 KV 张量，并在加载时重构它们。"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:64
msgid ""
"``preset`` (default ``turboquant_k8v4``), ``head_dim`` (optional, default"
" 128), ``block_size`` (default 16), ``max_workers`` (thread pool size, "
"default 1)"
msgstr ""
"``preset``（默认 ``turboquant_k8v4``），``head_dim``（可选，默认 "
"128），``block_size``（默认 16），``max_workers``（线程池大小，默认 1）"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:67
msgid "``aesgcm``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:68
msgid ""
"AES-GCM authenticated encryption of KV bytes at rest in L2, keyed per "
"``cache_salt``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:70
msgid ""
"``key_provider`` (default ``hkdf``), ``master_key_path`` (required for "
"``hkdf``), ``aes_bits`` (``128`` default, or ``256``), ``max_workers`` "
"(thread pool size, default 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:76
msgid "TurboQuant serde"
msgstr "TurboQuant 序列化与反序列化"

#: ../../source/mp/serde.rst:78
msgid ""
"TurboQuant serde can be enabled by setting ``\"type\": \"turboquant\"`` "
"in the adapter serde config. If ``preset`` is omitted, TurboQuant serde "
"defaults to ``turboquant_k8v4``."
msgstr ""
"TurboQuant serde 可以通过在适配器 serde 配置中设置 ``\"type\": \"turboquant\"`` "
"来启用。如果省略 ``preset``，TurboQuant serde 默认使用 ``turboquant_k8v4``。"

